## Directory Structure
```
Phase5_SVM_Kernel_RFF_Results/
├── phase5_run.py               # Master single-command pipeline runner
├── requirements.txt            # Pinned dependency requirements
├── README.md                   # This documentation and reproduction guide
├── source/                     # Modular Python source code
│   ├── utils.py                # Shared hashing and memory-conscious NPZ loaders
│   ├── s01_integrity_gate.py   # Section 3: Hard data-integrity verification
│   ├── s02_qp_verification.py  # Section 5: Dual QP solver and KKT residual checks
│   ├── s03_stage_a_linear_svm.py # Section 4 & 6: Scaler fitting + 40 LinearSVC fits
│   ├── s04_stage_b_rbf_svc.py  # Section 7: Exact RBF SVC & OvR/OvO ablation
│   ├── s05_stage_c_rff.py      # Section 8: Random Fourier Features & kernel approx
│   ├── s06_selection_and_evaluation.py # Section 9, 10, 11, 12: Selection, Markov & Test
│   └── s07_comparative_studies.py # Section 13: PCA vs HoSVD, Pareto & Block Bootstrap
├── tests/                      # Automated test suite
│   ├── test_qp.py              # Synthetic QP optimality and KKT unit tests
│   └── test_phase5_full.py     # 14 comprehensive schema, leakage & metric tests
├── models/                     # Saved frozen scalers, final models & calibrators
├── results/                    # Numerical candidate metrics, ablation tables, CIs
├── predictions/                # Aligned prediction CSVs on validation and test
├── figures/                    # Publication-quality evaluation plots
├── manifests/                  # Provenance checksums, locked model selection
├── reports/                    # Mathematical derivations, how-to-run, audit summary
└── logs/                       # Full execution logs, timings, memory benchmarks
```

